User input: Move goal to the point between beginning and middle of lane 665
Output: {"target_edge": "665", "position": "quarter"}

User input: Set goal at 1/4 of edge 661
Output: {"target_edge": "661", "position": "quarter"}

User input: Place goal between middle and end of lane 665
Output: {"target_edge": "665", "position": "three_quarter"}

User input: Move goal to 3/4 point of lanelet 12345
Output: {"target_edge": "12345", "position": "three_quarter"}

